DFD LEVEL 0 (CONTEXT DIAGRAM) DESCRIPTION (PLACEHOLDER CONTENT)

External Entities:
- Admin
- Teacher
- Camera/AI Source

Central System:
- Face Detection Attendance System

Data Flows:
1) Admin -> System
- Login credentials
- User/student management actions
- Attendance queries and reports requests

2) Teacher -> System
- Login credentials
- Attendance view/filter requests
- Manual attendance marking

3) Camera/AI Source -> System
- Recognized student attendance events

4) System -> Admin/Teacher
- Authentication response
- Student lists/details
- Attendance records and summary reports

5) System -> Database
- Store/update users, students, attendance

6) Database -> System
- Requested data for authentication, management, reporting
